Blessed Guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras/c06be59dd4172ead6392b4735b53e12a.avif?t=1768314743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/extras_big/c06be59dd4172ead6392b4735b53e12a.avif?t=1768314743 width=800 height=1067 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BONUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include a roguelike/STORE system allowing you to unlock new units to fight more effectively thanks to the divine rewards you collect in battle.</p>","developers":["Oedipe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677580/afe9dc9a3707e3b82acf707fdd171fa454ae9f97/header.jpg?t=1768314743","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Game has been made by Eddy CHARLES from Oedipe Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3677580/1282996017/24bc14aea6a66e811af8b54261701ac01f62c601/1750398767/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748010742","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3677580/1282996017/24bc14aea6a66e811af8b54261701ac01f62c601/1750398767/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748010742","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3677580/1282996017/24bc14aea6a66e811af8b54261701ac01f62c601/1750398767/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748010742","id":257144305,"name":"Blest official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a